Huh? Eh, maybe.

779
00:04:24,950 --> 00:04:26,040
Here.

780
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,290
I'll take that.

781
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,290
Du Fu says:

782
00:04:30,290 --> 00:04:33,250
"If you shoot a horseman, first shoot his horse."

783
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:34,170
What does that mean?

784
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:38,010
It means "cozy up to the younger brothers,
then the older sister will surely like you."

785
00:04:38,010 --> 00:04:39,430
Oh, yeah?

786
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:46,850
Why is the very person who said,
"We're gonna clean up!" not coming?

787
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,940
Wanna go home, then?

788
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:53,520
Just to annoy her, I'm gonna make everything 
sparking clean before she gets here!

789
00:04:54,930 --> 00:04:56,530
You're twisted.

790
00:05:05,450 --> 00:05:08,700
Onee-chan! How was your date yesterday?

791
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:12,540
It wasn't a date. Mitsuru 
and Yuzuru were with me, after all.

792
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,630
They seemed to be having fun.

793
00:05:15,630 --> 00:05:16,920
What about you?

794
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:20,220
I had fun going out with everyone.

795
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:24,430
I've never done that before, 
so I didn't really get it at first.

796
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:26,390
How were you invited?

797
00:05:26,390 --> 00:05:29,850
He just casually asked, "Are you free tomorrow? 
Wanna go to the aquarium?"

798
00:05:29,850 --> 00:05:31,060
That's it?

799
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:31,940
Yeah.

800
00:05:31,940 --> 00:05:34,900
You won't be helpful at all!

801
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:36,690
Helpful for what?

802
00:05:36,690 --> 00:05:39,990
You told me before! That there was a boy you liked!

803
00:05:39,990 --> 00:05:42,860
I thought I'd ask you about all sorts of things!

804
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,370
Why don't you ask Mom?

805
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:48,370
Ugh. Dad's undies.

806
00:05:48,370 --> 00:05:50,040
Onee-chan!

807
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,120
Yoriko's here!

808
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,120
She came to play!

809
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,540
Thanks for letting me in!

810
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,710
Hello.

811
00:05:54,710 --> 00:05:57,630
By Mitsuru 
and Yuzuru

812
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:58,840
They really liked Soma, huh?

